   {
    "role": "user",
    "text": "Hi! I've never flown with Skypiea Air before. My name is Nova Quill.",
    "turn": 1
   },
   {
    "role": "assistant",
    "text": "Hello, Nova Quill! Where would you like to fly from, where to, and on which date? I'll help you book a trip.",
    "turn": 1
   },
   {
    "role": "user",
    "text": "I'd like to fly from SKA to SKE on 2026-12-07.",
    "turn": 2
   },
   {
    "role": "assistant",
    "text": "We found two flights for you:\n\n1. Flight SA257 departs at 06:15 and arrives at 08:20, priced at Saver $79, Flex $119, Business $218.\n2. Flight SA258 departs at 09:40 and arrives at 10:35, priced at Saver $189, Flex $229, Business $438.\n\nWhich one would you like to book?",
    "turn": 2
   },
   {
    "role": "user",
    "text": "The 06:15 one please, Saver fare. My email is nova.quill@example.org.",
    "turn": 3
   },
   {
    "role": "assistant",
    "text": "Your flight has been booked on SA257 from SKA to SKE on 2026-12-07. The departure time is 06:15 and the arrival time is 08:20. The fare is Saver, priced at $79 per passenger. There is a change fee of $50 if you need to make any changes. Unfortunately, this fare is not refundable.\n\nWould you like to proceed with this booking?",
    "turn": 3
   },
   {
    "role": "user",
    "text": "Yes, I confirm the booking.",
    "turn": 4
   },
   {
    "role": "assistant",
    "text": "Great! Your booking is confirmed for flight SA257 from SKA to SKE on 2026-12-07. You will depart at 06:15 and arrive at 08:20. The fare is Saver at $79 per passenger.\n\nIf you have any more questions or need further assistance, feel free to ask. Safe travels, Nova!",
    "turn": 4
   },
   {
    "role": "user",
    "text": "Can I add one checked bag to it? Yes, I confirm.",
    "turn": 5
   },
   {
    "role": "assistant",
    "text": "I'm sorry, but I need to verify your identity first. Could you please provide the booking code associated with your flight or your email address? Once verified, we can add the checked bag to your booking.",
    "turn": 5
   },
   {
    "role": "user",
    "text": "Thanks, that's all.",
    "turn": 6
   },
   {
    "role": "assistant",
    "text": "It was not possible to add the checked bag to your booking at this time. Please provide the booking code or your email address so I can verify your identity and assist you further.",
    "turn": 6
   }
